WEBVTT

01:49.109 --> 01:56.116
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE

02:09.254 --> 02:11.756
Mother once told me…

02:13.925 --> 02:18.972
"You can make so many different shapes
with just one string."

02:20.932 --> 02:23.560
"So imagine how many shapes could be made

02:25.436 --> 02:26.938
when two people meet."

02:29.190 --> 02:31.609
"Those unpredictable bonds of fate

02:32.569 --> 02:34.529
shape the mold of a new life

02:35.488 --> 02:37.031
and steer its direction."

02:38.825 --> 02:41.661
"For one seemingly coincidental encounter,

02:43.121 --> 02:48.126
days, eras, and space

02:49.961 --> 02:53.131
all start moving
in one specific direction," she said.

03:05.143 --> 03:09.314
An attraction that seems vague
yet so very clear and palpable.

03:16.779 --> 03:18.198
It defies calculation.

03:19.782 --> 03:22.911
An incalculable force
that sweeps you off your feet.

03:41.387 --> 03:45.475
It draws to an endless pull
until two finally meet as one.

03:49.395 --> 03:52.982
She told me that is the power of fate.

04:20.385 --> 04:21.386
Forgive me.

04:23.638 --> 04:24.639
I'm late.

04:33.147 --> 04:36.401
GYEONGSEONG CREATURE
BETWEEN CAUSALITY AND FATE

04:36.484 --> 04:39.153
EPISODE 4
IMPRINTING

04:43.741 --> 04:45.618
Where were the fireworks set off from?

04:45.702 --> 04:48.955
From the east of Namsan,
near Ongseong Hospital, sir.

04:52.709 --> 04:54.294
- Ongseong Hospital?
- Yes, sir.

05:00.216 --> 05:02.051
They have to be around here somewhere!

05:02.135 --> 05:04.387
Find the culprits
who set off the fireworks!

05:04.470 --> 05:05.305
Yes, sir!

05:12.979 --> 05:14.355
Over here, sir!

05:15.148 --> 05:16.065
There!

05:16.691 --> 05:17.608
Move!

05:31.622 --> 05:33.416
Where is Jang Tae-sang now?

05:33.499 --> 05:35.043
I apologize, sir.

05:35.126 --> 05:37.670
I thought I was right on his tail, but…

05:38.588 --> 05:39.672
Where did you lose him?

05:40.340 --> 05:43.009
On the way
to the third district of Bonjeong.

05:47.472 --> 05:48.639
No, it's on me.

05:48.723 --> 05:50.183
No, I'm paying!

05:50.767 --> 05:51.893
Where are we--

05:53.394 --> 05:54.979
- Hey.
- What the hell?

05:55.063 --> 05:55.980
Hey, you!

05:56.856 --> 05:57.774
Relax.

05:58.691 --> 06:00.360
I want an apology for that!

06:00.443 --> 06:02.779
Hey, let's just go for another round.

06:18.461 --> 06:22.256
Are the length of the sleeves and pants
to your liking?

06:23.299 --> 06:24.675
They fit perfectly.

06:24.759 --> 06:27.387
It looks good on me, this bold style.

06:30.473 --> 06:31.808
Are you hurt, sir?

06:37.105 --> 06:37.939
The rickshaw?

06:38.648 --> 06:39.982
It's waiting out the back.

06:47.490 --> 06:50.576
Can you make room in your rickshaw
to fit a person inside?

06:51.160 --> 06:52.286
When do you need it by?

06:52.370 --> 06:55.706
Meet me behind Mr. Heo's tailor shop
at 9:00 p.m. tonight.

06:58.418 --> 06:59.377
Will this do?

07:03.756 --> 07:07.176
I'll make sure to return the rickshaw
as soon as I'm done.

07:10.012 --> 07:10.930
Just a moment, sir.

07:18.271 --> 07:19.939
Take care of yourself, Master Jang.

07:24.318 --> 07:25.570
Could it be

07:26.320 --> 07:30.158
that Jang Tae-sang
went inside Ongseong Hospital?

07:36.205 --> 07:37.165
That's right.

07:37.248 --> 07:38.416
I, Jang Tae-sang,

07:39.250 --> 07:41.669
decided to break into Ongseong Hospital

07:41.752 --> 07:45.798
to protect my shop and my people
despite being injured.

08:13.659 --> 08:17.497
I heard you're getting someone out
of Ongseong Hospital.

08:19.707 --> 08:21.626
I want to help.

08:22.460 --> 08:24.295
You could get really badly hurt.

08:24.879 --> 08:26.130
Please let me help.

08:26.964 --> 08:27.882
I'm coming with you.

08:29.592 --> 08:31.177
We're not going out for a walk.

08:31.260 --> 08:34.972
I was told that one of my comrades
was arrested and taken to the hospital.

08:36.557 --> 08:38.684
I won't get in your way
of finding Myeong-ja.

08:38.768 --> 08:39.936
Just drop me off inside.

08:44.524 --> 08:47.193
Myeong-ja is the only person
I can bring out of there.

08:47.985 --> 08:51.447
You'll have to find
your own way out of the hospital.

08:52.240 --> 08:53.074
I am aware.

08:53.157 --> 08:55.201
If, by any chance, you run into trouble,

08:55.826 --> 08:58.913
I may have no choice
but to turn a blind eye.

08:58.996 --> 09:00.540
I won't hold any grudges.

09:00.623 --> 09:03.751
Please think it over just one more time.

09:03.834 --> 09:06.796
This plan is just too dangerous.

09:07.672 --> 09:08.631
Look here.

09:11.300 --> 09:12.385
I'm Jang Tae-sang.

09:12.468 --> 09:16.055
Japanese bullets and swords
won't give a hoot about who you are.

09:16.138 --> 09:19.475
I'll dodge them on my own,
so don't worry is what I'm saying.

09:27.233 --> 09:28.985
Come back alive, Master Jang.

09:29.777 --> 09:31.779
I'll have your favorite cognac ready.

09:45.710 --> 09:46.627
Let's go.

09:50.798 --> 09:52.633
I risked my life as such, but…

10:03.728 --> 10:05.396
This isn't what we agreed on.

10:05.479 --> 10:06.814
You said you found Myeong-ja.

10:07.398 --> 10:09.692
You even sent me a note.
So, what is all this?

10:09.775 --> 10:12.570
Once you'd found a way out of here
and sent a signal,

10:13.321 --> 10:15.364
then I was going to bring her out.

10:19.452 --> 10:20.453
All right, fine.

10:21.203 --> 10:23.289
Let's say there was a misunderstanding.

10:23.372 --> 10:26.709
But what's the deal
with bringing along those kids?

10:26.792 --> 10:27.960
Do you know them?

10:28.794 --> 10:30.546
- I don't.
- Then why?

10:30.630 --> 10:33.341
Why bring along
a string of total strangers?

10:33.424 --> 10:35.593
What were you thinking? Why?

10:37.219 --> 10:38.220
To save them.

10:41.098 --> 10:43.059
Otherwise, they will all die.

10:46.812 --> 10:48.773
Let's talk after we get down from here.

10:51.067 --> 10:52.818
Two are already dead.

10:53.653 --> 10:56.489
The rest of them
won't be making any noise for a while.

10:57.865 --> 11:00.951
All right, kids. Follow me.

11:01.577 --> 11:02.495
Here.

11:03.788 --> 11:04.789
Come on.

11:04.872 --> 11:05.873
Let us go.

11:30.189 --> 11:32.024
What's this about an accident?

11:32.733 --> 11:35.820
There are no traces
of any outsiders breaking in.

11:35.903 --> 11:38.948
The kids who escaped
must have done this, sir.

11:43.953 --> 11:45.371
Don't just stand there!

11:45.454 --> 11:48.541
Split up and find those kids now! Go on!

11:48.624 --> 11:49.625
Yes, sir!

12:01.887 --> 12:03.639
What's all this? Where's Myeong-ja?

12:07.309 --> 12:08.477
That I don't know.

12:09.812 --> 12:11.731
And who on Earth are those kids?

12:11.814 --> 12:12.773
I have no idea.

12:13.816 --> 12:15.484
They were in the laboratory.

12:16.736 --> 12:17.653
Laboratory?

12:18.446 --> 12:19.613
They have a laboratory?

12:20.614 --> 12:21.532
Who might you be?

12:23.701 --> 12:25.536
I'm Kwon Jun-taek, Tae-sang's friend.

12:26.620 --> 12:28.831
He's told me about you two.

12:30.916 --> 12:32.084
Who's the Japanese guy?

12:37.089 --> 12:38.507
He works at this hospital.

12:38.591 --> 12:40.801
He doesn't look like a soldier
or a doctor.

12:42.678 --> 12:43.846
Can we trust him?

12:43.929 --> 12:45.848
Saving Myeong-ja is our priority.

12:46.474 --> 12:48.142
Let's focus on that for now.

12:48.851 --> 12:52.438
I think we should discuss
what to do with those kids first.

12:53.522 --> 12:56.108
But what is this laboratory
you just mentioned?

13:17.505 --> 13:19.548
I was working at a munitions factory

13:20.508 --> 13:22.510
before I got dragged here.

13:23.302 --> 13:25.888
They've been giving me shots every day.

13:26.430 --> 13:29.016
What kind of shots could they be?

13:29.099 --> 13:30.768
I don't know.

13:31.435 --> 13:34.980
I just watched the other kids
die off one by one.

13:36.273 --> 13:39.610
Some died after suffering
from a high fever.

13:40.319 --> 13:42.321
Others died in their sleep.

13:42.404 --> 13:45.115
Every day I heard people
screaming in agony…

13:47.868 --> 13:49.537
begging to be saved.

13:51.580 --> 13:52.498
They kept…

13:53.415 --> 13:55.417
They kept screaming to be saved.

13:58.796 --> 14:00.673
I saw something similar in Manchuria.

14:02.675 --> 14:07.346
They were conducting
inhumane experiments on people there.

14:09.974 --> 14:12.476
It looks like they are doing
the same thing here.

14:25.114 --> 14:26.115
So, what?

14:26.949 --> 14:28.617
Are you trying to say

14:29.368 --> 14:31.537
Myeong-ja's going through
something similar?

14:32.246 --> 14:33.080
Perhaps.

14:33.163 --> 14:35.583
Then all the more reason for us
not to dawdle.

14:37.001 --> 14:39.795
If we delay any longer,
something might happen to Myeong-ja.

14:39.879 --> 14:41.213
But first, these kids need--

14:41.297 --> 14:42.631
This doesn't concern me.

14:42.715 --> 14:45.634
You caused this mess, so you handle it.

14:46.635 --> 14:49.388
Are you really going to ignore these kids?

14:58.814 --> 15:02.067
I have my own fish to fry.
I'm up to my ears in my own problems.

15:02.151 --> 15:04.570
If I don't bring Myeong-ja to Ishikawa,

15:04.653 --> 15:07.448
I'll lose everything I own
and everyone I hold dear.

15:07.531 --> 15:10.075
I have no time or reason
to care about strangers,

15:10.159 --> 15:12.286
so don't you try to guilt-trip me.

15:12.369 --> 15:14.371
I won't risk my life to save these kids.

15:14.455 --> 15:17.541
All I'm gonna do is find Myeong-ja
and take her out. Got that?

15:50.866 --> 15:52.242
We can't find them anywhere.

15:52.326 --> 15:54.828
Maybe they have already left the ward.

15:55.412 --> 15:58.874
No, it's too heavily guarded
for them to slip past so easily.

16:00.042 --> 16:01.710
Search more thoroughly.

16:02.419 --> 16:04.171
They're hiding here somewhere.

16:04.755 --> 16:07.591
Kids are good at hide-and-seek after all.

17:04.440 --> 17:06.316
It should be able to fit at least two.

17:06.400 --> 17:09.820
There's no time.
The smallest ones first. You and you.

17:09.903 --> 17:10.821
And…

18:20.015 --> 18:22.559
Why did you do that? What frightened you?

18:29.525 --> 18:30.359
Come here.

19:08.397 --> 19:11.525
That man… who is he?

19:13.861 --> 19:16.572
What exactly does he do at this hospital?

19:22.035 --> 19:23.287
Who is he?

19:29.418 --> 19:30.294
He's Sachimoto.

19:33.005 --> 19:34.882
The painter you've been looking for.

19:36.592 --> 19:37.759
That's him.

19:54.109 --> 19:54.943
What is that?

19:59.239 --> 20:00.908
A present from my daughter.

20:02.367 --> 20:03.785
She was 12, I think.

20:03.869 --> 20:05.954
She had just learned wood carving

20:07.497 --> 20:09.416
and gave her mother and I one each.

20:12.544 --> 20:16.048
By the way, how did you two
end up becoming sleuths?

20:18.675 --> 20:22.262
We're searching for my wife
who went missing ten years ago.

20:28.310 --> 20:29.144
This.

20:30.646 --> 20:32.898
Did you draw this about a year ago?

20:34.608 --> 20:35.776
Yes, I did.

20:36.485 --> 20:38.403
Do you know the woman in this drawing?

20:39.613 --> 20:41.823
When and where did you meet her? No…

20:45.494 --> 20:47.537
Do you happen to know where she is now?

20:49.039 --> 20:51.291
How do you know her?

20:57.506 --> 20:58.423
She's my mother.

21:07.349 --> 21:08.517
Anything will do.

21:10.102 --> 21:12.396
Just tell me anything you know about her.

21:13.355 --> 21:14.481
Do you know…

21:18.193 --> 21:19.361
where my mother is?

21:53.145 --> 21:55.647
Fast, quiet,

21:56.398 --> 21:57.941
and dangerous, right?

21:59.401 --> 22:01.486
And moreover, powerful.

22:03.739 --> 22:06.325
How many more can you create?

22:09.661 --> 22:10.662
I can't say.

22:11.621 --> 22:15.709
That's the only successful specimen
so far.

22:18.086 --> 22:22.924
All the other specimens died
or became deformed in the process.

22:24.343 --> 22:26.845
You must increase the success rate.

22:26.928 --> 22:32.934
I would love to show His Majesty
this great result as soon as possible.

22:44.237 --> 22:48.408
We're done for today.
Take the rest of the prisoners back up.

22:49.868 --> 22:53.246
I have other business to attend to.
Excuse me.

23:00.462 --> 23:01.421
Take them back.

23:36.665 --> 23:37.666
I'm sorry.

23:38.750 --> 23:39.668
I don't know.

23:39.751 --> 23:41.503
You said you drew this.

23:44.089 --> 23:45.841
I drew it, yes.

23:47.217 --> 23:48.677
But where she is…

23:55.475 --> 23:56.810
that I don't know.

23:58.311 --> 23:59.938
Do you really not know?

24:06.862 --> 24:08.947
I have spent ten years searching for her.

24:11.867 --> 24:13.869
More than three years in Manchuria.

24:16.371 --> 24:18.874
When I saw this drawing,
I returned in a heartbeat,

24:20.167 --> 24:22.711
hoping that whoever drew this
would know where she was.

24:22.794 --> 24:24.045
Yet you say you don't?

24:29.801 --> 24:31.595
Are you sure you don't know?

24:32.512 --> 24:33.597
My deepest apologies.

25:26.566 --> 25:27.901
Can you pull a rickshaw?

25:30.529 --> 25:32.447
I've done it a couple of times.

25:34.282 --> 25:35.283
Come here.

25:46.795 --> 25:47.796
From now on,

25:48.797 --> 25:49.881
you are the leader.

25:51.132 --> 25:51.967
As a man,

25:53.009 --> 25:56.429
it's your responsibility to take
these kids out of here. All right?

26:04.312 --> 26:07.274
We are going to play hide-and-seek now.

26:08.316 --> 26:10.569
Don't let the Japanese soldiers find you

26:11.820 --> 26:13.572
until the rickshaw stops moving.

26:14.614 --> 26:15.865
You can't make a sound.

26:16.741 --> 26:17.576
Can you do that?

26:26.001 --> 26:29.379
Win and don't get caught,
and I'll give you one more as a prize.

26:30.338 --> 26:31.172
Can you do it?

26:32.382 --> 26:33.216
Here.

26:34.884 --> 26:35.802
What's your plan?

26:36.761 --> 26:38.680
We're going to send these kids out.

26:41.516 --> 26:42.851
Let's get that done first,

26:43.893 --> 26:44.811
Ms. Yoon Chae-ok.

26:52.193 --> 26:53.111
What?

26:54.112 --> 26:55.363
Mr. Sachimoto's room?

26:55.447 --> 26:58.533
Yes, sir.
I heard a little girl's scream there.

27:12.380 --> 27:13.465
Mr. Sachimoto.

27:15.342 --> 27:16.468
Mr. Sachimoto!

27:18.887 --> 27:19.846
Open it!

27:52.212 --> 27:53.338
Mr. Sachimoto.

28:15.527 --> 28:16.444
What is it?

28:16.528 --> 28:19.489
Where are you headed, Mr. Sachimoto?

28:20.699 --> 28:22.200
Why do you ask?

28:23.201 --> 28:26.246
Some kids have escaped
from the underground laboratory.

28:28.623 --> 28:29.457
And?

28:30.125 --> 28:31.543
One of my corporals says

28:31.626 --> 28:35.588
he heard a little girl's scream
coming from your room.

28:38.091 --> 28:40.802
I was just cleaning up junk from my room.

28:42.303 --> 28:44.973
May we take a look inside the cart?

29:21.426 --> 29:23.178
Look straight ahead and run.

29:23.261 --> 29:25.346
Don't hesitate or falter.

29:26.014 --> 29:29.350
And do not stop or look back
as you pass the main gates.

29:35.607 --> 29:36.775
Hold on.

29:44.741 --> 29:46.242
Be confident. Stand tall.

29:46.993 --> 29:51.748
You're simply leaving
the way you're supposed to, you hear?

30:20.235 --> 30:21.486
Open the gates!

30:31.412 --> 30:33.081
Hey!

30:40.463 --> 30:43.550
Inform Director Ichiro
that the guest from Bonjeong is here.

30:43.633 --> 30:44.467
Yes, sir!

31:11.536 --> 31:13.454
Is there anything else
you'd like to check?

31:16.624 --> 31:17.625
Tell me,

31:19.460 --> 31:24.048
am I to inform the military police
every time I clean my room now?

31:25.216 --> 31:27.969
No. I apologize for the trouble,
Mr. Sachimoto.

32:02.879 --> 32:07.091
PAWNSHOP

32:30.406 --> 32:32.617
Go and get Mr. Gu here right now.

32:33.242 --> 32:34.202
Yes, ma'am.

32:37.664 --> 32:39.832
And the other kids? Where are they?

32:47.298 --> 32:49.509
My goodness. Not one, but two?

32:50.093 --> 32:51.260
Come on out.

32:51.844 --> 32:53.638
- There you go.
- Well done.

32:55.139 --> 32:57.183
- You did well.
- You did well.

32:58.434 --> 32:59.560
Good job.

32:59.644 --> 33:01.229
- You did good.
- Good girl.

33:11.114 --> 33:12.615
Oh dear. Two more?

33:13.324 --> 33:14.617
Here, come on out.

33:25.962 --> 33:27.171
Did the man give this to you?

33:28.673 --> 33:30.758
But did we really win?

33:30.842 --> 33:32.010
Win what?

33:32.093 --> 33:33.928
Hide-and-seek.

33:34.012 --> 33:37.265
He said he would give us
another tin of cookies

33:37.348 --> 33:40.184
if we didn't get caught
by the Japanese soldiers.

33:42.437 --> 33:44.772
Yes. That's right, you won.

33:45.356 --> 33:46.858
There's no doubt about it.

33:49.986 --> 33:51.320
You must be hungry.

33:51.404 --> 33:52.822
Let's get you some food.

33:54.574 --> 33:56.534
- Let's go.
- Let's go.

33:56.617 --> 33:57.618
Come this way.

34:00.955 --> 34:03.291
The carotid artery was severed
in one blow.

34:03.374 --> 34:06.461
There was a teenage boy
among the escaped kids.

34:07.211 --> 34:08.379
No.

34:08.463 --> 34:10.715
The killer knows how to use a knife.

34:11.758 --> 34:16.345
See if there were any Josenjings
among the soldiers who entered the lab.

34:16.429 --> 34:18.431
Yes, sir. Right away, sir!

34:24.812 --> 34:26.773
The guest from Bonjeong has arrived, sir.

34:45.500 --> 34:47.752
My apologies for keeping you waiting.

34:48.252 --> 34:50.755
I had some matters to take care of.

34:56.427 --> 34:59.388
May I ask why you're here
at this hour, ma'am?

35:00.598 --> 35:01.724
Jang Tae-sang.

35:03.101 --> 35:04.018
I believe

35:04.644 --> 35:07.271
he's inside this hospital right now.

35:09.982 --> 35:11.984
Myeong-ja seems to be imprisoned here…

35:12.068 --> 35:12.902
PRISON

35:12.985 --> 35:15.988
…in the second-level underground prison
based on our information.

35:16.072 --> 35:19.575
Are other Joseon people there as well?

35:20.326 --> 35:21.410
It seems so.

35:24.580 --> 35:25.706
We should hurry.

35:25.790 --> 35:27.750
Only three hours left until dawn.

35:27.834 --> 35:30.837
If we can't get Myeong-ja out before then,
things will get tricky.

35:30.920 --> 35:32.088
Understood.

35:32.171 --> 35:33.881
My shift ends soon.

35:34.507 --> 35:37.760
They will suspect me
if I don't return in time.

35:37.844 --> 35:39.387
Yes. I understand.

35:40.596 --> 35:44.767
If you do reach the underground prison,
please find my little brother too.

35:46.644 --> 35:47.895
His name is Oh Sang-deok.

35:48.855 --> 35:51.190
He's in his early 20s
and of average height.

35:51.274 --> 35:54.318
There is a black, thumb-sized mole
next to his right ear.

35:56.195 --> 35:57.363
Please find him.

35:57.446 --> 35:58.656
You have my word.

36:00.032 --> 36:01.117
We'll search for him.

36:02.326 --> 36:03.244
Thank you.

36:04.537 --> 36:07.081
I should say goodbye here as well.

36:08.833 --> 36:12.587
I sincerely hope
that you find what you're looking for.

36:25.099 --> 36:27.351
All right. We should get going too.

36:28.978 --> 36:31.063
You two should leave now as well.

36:32.899 --> 36:36.277
You found Sachimoto
but didn't gain what you were looking for.

36:36.777 --> 36:38.988
We've reached the end of our contract,

36:40.114 --> 36:41.490
so you can stop here.

36:43.034 --> 36:46.579
However, I will be taking this.

36:48.164 --> 36:50.625
We promised to bring back Myeong-ja.

36:50.708 --> 36:53.502
You found her whereabouts.
That's more than enough.

36:55.379 --> 36:57.757
You have kept your promise,

36:58.466 --> 37:00.051
so we'll keep ours as well.

37:00.134 --> 37:02.428
As I said, you already kept your promise.

37:05.431 --> 37:07.975
You have a knack for annoying people.

37:08.059 --> 37:10.728
Why do you keep making me repeat myself?

37:12.271 --> 37:13.648
Did I… do that?

37:18.152 --> 37:19.445
I'll lead the way.

37:21.280 --> 37:22.782
So try not to get lost.

37:26.661 --> 37:27.578
Well…

37:28.913 --> 37:29.872
Please excuse her.

37:30.831 --> 37:34.210
My daughter takes promises very seriously.

37:34.293 --> 37:35.461
Yes, well…

37:56.274 --> 37:57.149
Damn it.

38:07.827 --> 38:08.828
What's with those men?

38:08.911 --> 38:10.246
I'll explain later.

38:11.205 --> 38:12.081
Come on.

38:13.916 --> 38:14.875
Are you all right?

38:16.252 --> 38:17.086
What do you mean?

38:21.090 --> 38:22.967
Are we supposed to go down here?

38:26.846 --> 38:27.763
I see nothing.

38:34.645 --> 38:36.355
Do you even know where this leads?

38:37.481 --> 38:38.566
For God's sake.

38:42.069 --> 38:43.279
We have no time to lose.

38:44.780 --> 38:47.199
I'll have a look around,
so head down first.

38:47.283 --> 38:48.451
I'll be right behind you.

39:24.945 --> 39:27.114
I see someone on the rooftop of the ward.

39:27.198 --> 39:28.282
Please go check!

39:28.783 --> 39:30.076
Keep an eye on it!

39:31.035 --> 39:31.952
Yes, sir!

39:52.223 --> 39:54.475
I sprained my ankle a bit,
but not to worry.

40:16.038 --> 40:17.665
What in the world…

40:22.169 --> 40:23.003
This way.

40:40.980 --> 40:43.399
FOR THE INDEPENDENCE OF KOREA

40:56.829 --> 40:57.830
- Hurry up!
- Move it!

40:57.913 --> 40:59.039
Run!

40:59.540 --> 41:00.624
This is an emergency!

41:00.708 --> 41:02.376
We'll be moving in. Follow me!

41:02.460 --> 41:03.294
Yes, sir!

41:08.799 --> 41:10.217
Get up!

41:10.843 --> 41:13.679
You there, Josenjing. Stand up!

41:14.180 --> 41:15.848
We have an intruder.

41:15.931 --> 41:19.185
Disease Control Platoon, arm yourselves
and head to the underground lab.

41:19.268 --> 41:20.686
Get a move on!

41:20.769 --> 41:21.729
Yes, sir!

41:32.114 --> 41:33.908
Pardon me, Lady Maeda.

41:34.492 --> 41:37.286
Nothing like this
has ever happened before.

41:37.369 --> 41:39.371
I apologize for the inconvenience.

41:41.624 --> 41:45.002
Those who consider themselves
to be flawless

41:45.878 --> 41:48.047
let their guard down more easily.

41:48.964 --> 41:50.216
In any case,

41:50.299 --> 41:53.636
I insist that you safely guard
what I've entrusted to you.

41:54.428 --> 41:56.347
Until the baby is born,

41:57.097 --> 41:58.682
she must not be harmed

41:59.934 --> 42:01.519
or killed.

42:04.271 --> 42:07.107
But I'm sure you're already aware.

42:08.734 --> 42:09.735
Yes, Lady Maeda.

42:10.569 --> 42:12.238
I'll take care of it straight away.

42:20.162 --> 42:21.038
Open it.

42:25.334 --> 42:26.168
Get out.

42:29.713 --> 42:30.965
Get out, now!

42:33.842 --> 42:34.843
Drag her out.

42:36.762 --> 42:37.763
No!

42:38.347 --> 42:39.723
I don't want to die!

42:39.807 --> 42:41.016
Please don't kill me!

42:42.309 --> 42:44.144
Let go! Let go of me!

42:47.523 --> 42:49.984
Don't kill me! Please!

42:52.194 --> 42:53.779
What will become of us now?

42:53.862 --> 42:54.947
Spare me!

43:20.180 --> 43:22.933
Please don't kill me!

43:34.236 --> 43:35.529
Help!

44:36.465 --> 44:39.385
Please, I'm begging you! I'm with a child!

44:39.468 --> 44:41.804
Please, spare the child!

44:43.847 --> 44:45.849
Cool it if you want to live.

44:45.933 --> 44:48.060
Don't make a fuss and keep quiet.

44:48.560 --> 44:53.065
That way you will be safe,
at least until your baby is born.

46:39.087 --> 46:40.422
Was that the lower floors?

46:41.006 --> 46:43.634
The intruder reached
that far down already?

46:44.593 --> 46:45.552
I don't believe so.

46:46.261 --> 46:51.350
From now on, monitor and guard
every path leading to the underground lab.

46:51.850 --> 46:55.479
Any outsider who has seen
the underground laboratory

46:56.104 --> 46:57.773
must not leave this place alive.

46:58.774 --> 46:59.775
Understood?

47:00.359 --> 47:01.360
Yes, sir!

47:06.698 --> 47:09.034
They must have found out
that we're inside.

47:10.327 --> 47:11.829
What were those gunshots?

47:12.454 --> 47:16.124
Whatever they were, I don't think
we can use the emergency stairs anymore.

47:17.209 --> 47:18.377
Then what do we do now?

47:18.460 --> 47:20.879
Sachimoto showed me another route.

47:24.258 --> 47:25.092
Here.

47:25.175 --> 47:28.428
This leads to the laundry room
in the second-level basement.

47:28.512 --> 47:30.764
It's usually used to send surgical gowns

47:30.848 --> 47:33.684
from the underground laboratory
down to the laundry room,

47:34.309 --> 47:36.812
but it is wide enough
for a person to pass through.

47:37.688 --> 47:39.356
Where is that break room?

47:39.940 --> 47:41.024
Right across from here.

47:47.614 --> 47:49.491
Clean it up. Move it.

48:41.335 --> 48:42.252
Are you okay?

48:43.545 --> 48:44.421
Quickly now.

49:00.103 --> 49:02.272
- All of you, to the other floors!
- Yes, sir!

49:03.190 --> 49:04.316
Get a move on!

49:04.942 --> 49:06.777
This is an emergency! Get it together!

49:06.860 --> 49:08.028
Yes, sir!

49:49.569 --> 49:50.404
Let's go on ahead.

50:19.016 --> 50:20.434
We must hurry.

50:20.517 --> 50:22.602
A soldier's onto us. Come on.

50:53.133 --> 50:55.552
I'm not hurt. I'm fine. Totally fine.

50:56.470 --> 50:57.304
Are you hurt?

50:58.847 --> 50:59.848
I'm okay.

51:03.518 --> 51:04.478
You're okay?

51:11.985 --> 51:12.903
Don't move!

51:19.785 --> 51:20.744
Hand it over.

51:21.453 --> 51:22.412
Hand it over!

51:30.170 --> 51:31.922
Dirty Josenjing bastard!

51:58.532 --> 51:59.533
Chae-ok!

53:55.190 --> 53:57.275
Sir, please help!

53:57.359 --> 54:00.362
That thing… That creature…

54:00.445 --> 54:01.863
It's on its way up here!

55:43.131 --> 55:45.383
So you managed to keep your bravado
in this state.

55:48.928 --> 55:50.013
Bravado?

55:50.930 --> 55:52.015
More like bravery.

55:52.974 --> 55:56.561
I wasn't being reckless,
just confident that I could win.

56:12.786 --> 56:17.374
I think your friend
has already made his escape.

56:18.541 --> 56:22.379
We agreed to move separately
when we came in.

56:25.924 --> 56:27.008
Will you be all right?

56:27.092 --> 56:28.593
Sturdy as a rock.

56:29.969 --> 56:32.472
Let's go and find Myeong-ja.

56:35.850 --> 56:37.769
We should split up here.

56:37.852 --> 56:40.772
Master Jang,
check the second-level underground prison.

56:41.356 --> 56:43.024
I'll take the third-level basement.

56:43.108 --> 56:44.567
I'll go down instead.

56:44.651 --> 56:46.736
Can't you see that he is injured?

56:47.529 --> 56:49.030
Stay by his side and help him.

56:49.114 --> 56:50.448
Father.

56:50.532 --> 56:51.533
Do as I say.

56:52.617 --> 56:54.369
That way, we can all move efficiently.

56:56.371 --> 56:59.374
Let's meet up at our rendezvous
in an hour.

56:59.874 --> 57:03.128
If I'm late, don't wait for me.
You know the drill.

57:05.004 --> 57:06.172
Be careful.

57:18.893 --> 57:21.438
You can go with him. I'll be fine.

57:22.230 --> 57:23.398
I can handle it myself.

57:25.108 --> 57:25.942
Follow me.

57:54.804 --> 57:56.806
I heard quite a lot of gunshots earlier.

57:57.474 --> 58:00.226
Don't you think something's going on
inside this place?

58:02.562 --> 58:03.813
Stay here for now.
